                                "sense_id": "6bcefeb4-4cb1-3174-bb49-4ab0a553cc84",
                                "text": "And if perchance some fleeting memories steal, Like far-off echoes to my dreaming ear, Away, ungrasped, the cheating visions wheel, As spectres start upon the wing of fear."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce326709-0db2-4630-8529-a6f88e2bb3f6",
                                "sense_id": "6bcefeb4-4cb1-3174-bb49-4ab0a553cc84",
                                "text": "All his life he had been hurrying desperately, and all his life the true moments had offered themselves and been left ungrasped."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
